00:10:53.333 --> 00:10:53.854
the next chunk,

00:10:53.893 --> 00:10:54.374
the next chunk,

00:10:54.414 --> 00:10:55.013
the next drunk,

00:10:55.294 --> 00:10:58.453
and something inside of the computer's memory remembers where it is.

